			x: 6.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5010C9FCE1E84D68"]
			description: ["The old galactic-centre probe will not leave the Galaxy. This one carries a Hawking drive, the navigation core, and MAX+ sensors and arms from the Circuits section."]
