			title: "The Platform at 30 Doradus"
			x: 16.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["15F0160069BFFC67", "77C42F51B49506CE"]
			description: ["The &6Tarantula Stellar Lift&r draws raw plasma from R136's very massive stars, and only here at the Tarantula. A filter and a former, which run anywhere, turn it into confined core plasma. Lift nozzles and the lift itself at this platform. The plasma mass filter and the FRC former can stand at home. Nickel-56 and the burner that eats it. The wind never stops, so the lift never starves."]
			icon: "gtceu:confined_vms_plasma_bucket"
			id: "161B334AA960BA09"
			rewards: [{ id: "525268B4C5BB80E7", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "17F20460F80D31DF", item: "gtceu:raw_vms_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }
				{ id: "74350A9B46466F23", item: "gtceu:vms_core_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5709CD10F6310B6A", item: "gtceu:confined_vms_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Plasma from the Heaviest Stars"
			x: 19.0d
			y: -3.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["54CF2F2C523D9619"]
			description: ["The &6pair-instability crucible&r burns the core plasma into nickel-56 slugs and ash from the star's heavier half. A liner for the crucible, and confined plasma in bulk. The nickel-56 cask, and the burner that eats it. The ash goes home to the older lines. Do not let it pile up. The crucible can run anywhere."]
			icon: "grindless:ni56_slug"
			id: "706F3E123B6112E3"
			rewards: [{ id: "54DE77B3B770FA27", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
