		{
			dependencies: ["57131618A8A6EBF3"]
			description: ["The meta-material loom weaves &6Horizon Shielding&r from a graded laminate, and a waveguide that the mK cryostat then chills. Gadolinium cermet from the ZPM line, and kerr strand for the waveguide. The tree's heat-proof parts. Keep the laminate and the tube on separate belts."]
