		{
			dependencies: ["3C1D7165C0C694E8"]
			description: ["The six casings of the horizon age, and the body they give the Hyperstargate. The first two wall almost every MAX+ structure; the rest each need iron-56 or a part only this age makes."]
			icon: "grindless:bound_lattice_casing"
