			title: "Bound Lattice Casing"
			x: 40.5d
			y: 12.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5175DDABD9A78869"]
			description: ["A casing wound with a Kerr field coil, which holds the field the bound matter is shaped in. It is the second wall of the age. An assembler, 400 ticks: a Kerr field coil, a bound lattice casing, a MAX emitter, a MAX electric pump,     two FFKM seals and a quarter bucket of superfluid helium-3, for two casings. The slingshot, the lift, the burner, the torus and the other Kerr-field structures. Coils by ME; the casing it is built on comes from the line before."]
			icon: "grindless:kerr_coil_casing"
			id: "306F166883A730AC"
			rewards: [{ id: "12F38C3CC0C23A92", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "180FAD038B2A1201", item: "grindless:kerr_coil_casing", type: "item" }]
			title: "Kerr Coil Casing"
			x: 43.0d
			y: 12.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["306F166883A730AC"]
			description: ["A casing of plate made of iron-56 with lithium-6 and tungsten, the most stable iron there is. It shields the polarised fusion stellarator and the pedestal of the Hyperstargate. An assembler, 400 ticks: six plates of iron-56, two lots of lithium-6, a tungsten plate, a MAX conveyor module, a MAX sensor, two FFKM seals and a quarter bucket of superfluid helium-3, for four casings. The polarised fusion stellarator and the Hyperstargate. Plates of iron-56 from the hot cell by ME; lithium-6 from its own line."]
			icon: "grindless:fe56_shield_casing"
			id: "195176BE06BA25F1"
