		{
			dependencies: ["195176BE06BA25F1"]
			description: ["A casing cooled by primordial helium-3, for the parts of a structure that must stay near absolute zero. An assembler, 400 ticks: two plates of iron-56, a helium-4 dewar, a NEG XHV casing, two MAX electric pumps, a MAX sensor, an OpV fluid regulator, two FFKM seals and a quarter bucket of pristine helium-3, for two casings. The polarised fusion stellarator and the cold channel of the Hyperstargate. Dewars and regulators by ME; pristine helium-3 by pipe from its line."]
			icon: "grindless:primordial_cryostat_casing"
