		{
			dependencies: ["50FBE76E93D9D6E3"]
			description: ["The hardest casing of the age and the jacket of the Hyperstargate: iron-56 and void diamond around a field generator. Almost half the gate is this block. The assembly line, 600 ticks, with the MAX field coil research: four plates of iron-56, a void-grown diamond, a MAX field coil, a MAX field generator, an OpV emitter, two FFKM seals and a quarter bucket of pristine helium-3, for two casings. The Hyperstargate. A dedicated line: the gate takes thousands of these, so every part must come from a line, never by hand."]
			icon: "grindless:horizon_gate_casing"
