		{
			dependencies: ["1EBBE33BC966BE23"]
			description: ["A silicon-28 wafer, spin-stacked on a racetrack fab and cut to size. The &6Horizon Logic Die&r is the logic half of the horizon processor. The calutron for pure silicon-28, crystal growth, the beam-ultraviolet scanner and the racetrack fab, six steps in all. The horizon processor. Stock the boules by ME; the cutter returns dies by chest, so give it a buffer."]
			icon: "grindless:horizon_logic_die"
