		{
			dependencies: ["1EBBE33BC966BE23"]
			description: ["The board that joins the dies with light, written by a femtosecond laser and chilled in the cryostat. The &6Horizon Interposer&r carries the waveguides between them. Thin-film lithium niobate, the femtosecond writer, molecular-beam epitaxy for the piezo layer and the millikelvin cryostat. The horizon processor. Keep one chest per interposer step; the cryostat is the slow one."]
			icon: "grindless:horizon_interposer"
			id: "10AB32F3FA89A75D"
