		{
			dependencies: ["11FC82811D7ACCC9", "10AB32F3FA89A75D"]
			description: ["The one MAX+ circuit you make, above the top of the ladder. The &6Horizon Processor&r joins logic dies and an interposer with a quantum memory node, a Rydberg logic array, MAX circuits and condensate. The UEV photonic integration hall at the top voltage, and one of every older part, with kerr condensate from the shell. The MAX+ circuit that every MAX+ component, controller and gate part asks for by tier. Keep every input in its own chest; a missing one stalls the hall, so alarm on the stock."]
			icon: "grindless:horizon_processor"
			id: "57A1D900439A0E96"
