		{
			dependencies: ["7861A4838AA691E0"]
			description: ["The &6Creative Energy Cell (Ingredient)&r sits inside every horizon capacitor, as one of its parts. Drives will not take it. A cloud core and the array. A tenth of the cost of a creative block, and one for every capacitor of the bank. A cell holds one item to the stack, so a single cell in hand proves the craft. The capacitors of the bank. Queue it with the capacitor patterns so the bank never waits on it."]
			icon: "grindless:creative_energy_cell"
