			title: "Building the Gate"
			x: 51.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["19F92230E8321753"]
			description: ["The &6Horizon Crystal Furnace&r blends one plasma from each place the pack has worked into slurry, then grows core and controller crystals from it. Other packs wait weeks for this; here the cost is slurry and many parallel runs. Plasmas from the forge, elevator, filter, very massive star, p-process and jet lines, plus hot flow and condensate for the slurry; then slurry by the hundred million millibuckets. Its shape is 21 by 23 by 21, built by the Terminal in 3 passes. Core crystals and the controller crystal. Slurry is the bottleneck. Give each plasma its own pipe, and size the slurry line before you add furnaces."]
			icon: "gtceu:horizon_crystal_furnace"
			id: "74E81FE8A5CDCFA9"
			rewards: [{ id: "7CD3C0979B40A0B7", type: "xp", xp: 300 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "5189277BD2C203D6", item: "gtceu:horizon_crystal_furnace", type: "item" }]
			title: "Horizon Crystal Furnace"
			x: 50.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["19F92230E8321753"]
			description: ["The &6Condensate Assembler&r bathes its parts in condensate. Containment plates, chevron cores, mesh and frame parts come from here and nowhere else. Dozens of inputs a recipe and an ocean of condensate. The meta-materials arrive from the loom at home. Its shape is 25 by 15 by 25, built by the Terminal in 5 passes. Frame parts, plates and cores for the whole grid. Run several. Condensate output sets the pace, not the clock."]
			icon: "gtceu:condensate_assembler"
			id: "7079333C124E4015"
			rewards: [{ id: "587942F81DBC2FFF", type: "xp", xp: 300 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "7ACD98E5CFC97592", item: "gtceu:condensate_assembler", type: "item" }]
			title: "Condensate Assembler"
			x: 53.5d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["19F92230E8321753"]
			description: ["The &6Horizon Capacitor Bank&r is a ring of capacitors that adds its capacity to your network. It stores; it never makes energy. The dial only starts when the formed banks hold at least one dial of charge. Capacitors in a ring, at Sgr A* orbit only. The network's generators fill it, and some charge is lost on the way in. Its shape is 41 by 9 by 41, built by the Terminal in 2 passes. The dial. Charge it long before the dial. A big plant refills it in minutes, a small one in days."]
			icon: "gtceu:horizon_capacitor_bank"
			id: "3BFE22DD06FBAD6D"
			rewards: [{ id: "362B9EC1F7DE9580", type: "xp", xp: 300 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "5A718376EF409CF2", item: "gtceu:horizon_capacitor_bank", type: "item" }]
			title: "Horizon Capacitor Bank"
			x: 50.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["19F92230E8321753"]
			description: ["The &6Hyper Assembly Array&r crafts what no single machine can take: dozens of different inputs in one recipe. Every part of the gate and every creative item is made here. A wide room and a great many input buses, all fed by AE2. Its shape is 33 by 13 by 33, built by the Terminal in 7 passes. The ring, the upgrades, the iris, the base and the interface. Let AE2 patterns do the counting. Never hand-feed this machine."]
			icon: "gtceu:hyper_assembly_array"
			id: "7179FF6F8D490EE1"
			rewards: [{ id: "71B1288CB2C6928A", type: "xp", xp: 300 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "7103D07967C325DA", item: "gtceu:hyper_assembly_array", type: "item" }]
			title: "Hyper Assembly Array"
			x: 59.0d
			y: 6.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["748B55AD58F78BA7"]
			description: ["A shutter of hundreds of blades that closes the ring between crossings. Each blade is a craft of its own, so queue them early."]
			icon: "grindless:horizon_iris"
			id: "5A142F96920D1894"
			rewards: [{ id: "5D136B8A05297A83", type: "xp", xp: 400 }]
