			x: 64.5d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7179FF6F8D490EE1"]
			description: ["The ring is made of them, and so are the chevron blocks, the base, the power units, the interface and the controller. Make far more than the ring itself needs."]
