		{
			dependencies: ["53DF70140A81AEA6", "33A2D7F5523AA48A"]
			description: ["Made like a chevron block, from ring blocks, upgrades and meta-materials, with a horizon lock and a crowd of MAX+ circuits sealed in. Nine of them go on the ring, and the dial recognises them by the lock."]
			icon: "grindless:hyperstargate_locked_chevron"
