			title: "Home Rows: UXV"
			x: 1.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5933EFF02E11707D"]
			description: ["The UIV controllers at home, and the MAX+ row each one takes: the millikelvin cryostat chills the waveguide, resonance chamber, field cell and core crystal; the femtosecond writer inscribes crystals and interposer waveguides; the BEUV scanner patterns wafers for the chevron cores and the controller crystal; the TFLN fab makes the modulator chips; the levitation melter melts the strange alloy; the spectral hole burner burns the store block. All seven controllers: Neutron Drip Works, levitation melter, TFLN fab, femtosecond writer, BEUV scanner, mK cryostat and spectral hole burner. Lattices, waveguides, and the stage's precise parts. The cryostat wants the cold plant next to it."]
			icon: "gtceu:levitation_melter"
			id: "197BA9E30B9592BF"
			rewards: [{ id: "75017B9ED37F85A5", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "169DF6D728633848", item: "gtceu:neutronium_cage", type: "item" }
				{ id: "3C2286020E3CB0AF", item: "gtceu:levitation_melter", type: "item" }
				{ id: "71E0BC2495F4DD83", item: "gtceu:tfln_fab", type: "item" }
