			x: 37.0d
			y: 2.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["57131618A8A6EBF3"]
			description: ["Four meta-materials in one machine: shielding, waveguide, conduit and the valve body. It weaves them from bound plates, strand and condensate, several steps in one. The MAX hull with horizon casings, MAX+ circuits, motors, pistons, arms and conveyors, and no pump or regulator, since those wait for the loom's own valves. A great many of each meta-material for the gate, and the valve bodies for the pumps. Run four recipes at once and give each its own output bus."]
			icon: "gtceu:meta_material_loom"
			id: "5B058893FFF286CB"
			rewards: [{ id: "5A5A19E9EB022D32", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
