			title: "Meta-Material Loom"
			x: 43.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["57131618A8A6EBF3"]
			description: ["The top of the mega family. It runs assembler, circuit assembler, assembly line, forming press and laser engraver at a far wider parallel than a single hatch gives. The MAX hull with horizon casings, MAX+ circuits, components and a MAX parallel hatch for the controller. In the structure, a parallel hatch (the MAX+ one gives the most) and the 1,024 A MAX+ energy hatch. The millions of parts the tree and the gate need. It is a convenience, not a step. Feed it by ME and let the parallels do the counting."]
			icon: "gtceu:hyperfactory"
			id: "3F5559CA9966BC46"
